	"Description": "GPU-accelerated continuous realm building for PrimordiaOS: MCP compute kernels (topology mutation, sigil fields, actor cognition, world memory) on the render graph, Onyx GPU telemetry and inspector, a Vulkan-aware realm renderer, and bindings to the PrimordiaOS realm bridge. Kernels are shared with the standalone Vulkan engine in realm-bridge/gpu.",
